step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model strategy with the top performer, rf, to see if a single model beats the robust median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the top‑5 models (pool1) to see if a simpler subset beats best_single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool with 20% trimming to see if a robust average of all models improves over best_single rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple median over pool2 to see if a smaller robust subset improves over full pool median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if expanding the subset helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Try a DTW barycenter (dba) on the smallest robust pool1 to see if a non‑linear combination beats the best_single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test dba on pool2 to see if a different DTW barycenter pool improves over pool1 and other baselines.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing pooled meta‑model handle w1 on the full pool to see if learned weighting improves over the best single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w1","models":["rf","THETA","ETS","ONLY_FT_catboost","catboost","ONLY_FT_rf","ARIMA","FT_rf"],"score_preset":"smape_pocid_50_50"}

Thought: Test a plain mean over the broader pool4 to see if adding ARIMA, ETS, THETA improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over pool4 to see if trimming improves upon the plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool4 to see if it beats the best single rf while keeping robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Evaluate a dba strategy on pool4 to see if iterative refinement beats existing robust combos.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a dba strategy on the more diverse pool3 to see if iterative refinement improves over existing combos.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

